# CommitGuard code owners.
#
# CommitGuard has a single maintainer today. This file documents who is
# responsible for reviewing each high-risk component. It becomes an enforced
# gate only when branch protection or a ruleset enables "Require review from
# Code Owners" (and, in practice, once there is more than one maintainer, since
# GitHub does not count an author's approval of their own pull request).
# See docs/maintainers/security.md.
#
# Order matters: the last matching pattern wins. Every path listed here was
# verified to exist when this file was written.

# Default owner for everything not listed below.
*                                                   @oyinlola-tech

